retired 2026-09-21 atMost unsupported 1990 - set on 2026-09-08 when the BigInt literal refusal was restored, and counting exactly the variants that refusal named; JSeal B05 implemented and admitted BigInt (JSD-0033 section 7), the whole run of 2026-09-21 names no unsupported family, and the row is re-set to 0 by hand because --admit re-bases only on a suite or manifest move.
